To address the issues:

1.  **"Synapsis Medical Evaluation" Name**: This specific string often persists in the browser cache or PWA manifest cache on mobile devices. I will forcefully bump the cache version in `sw.js` to **v29** and ensure `metadata.json` is clean. *Note: If you are referring to the project name in the Google Cloud Console (billing/API dashboard), that must be changed manually in the Google Cloud Console settings, as it cannot be changed via frontend code.*
2.  **Missing Speech-to-Text**: The microphone button was conditionally hidden if the browser didn't report immediate support. I will make the button **always visible** (but disabled with a tooltip if not supported) so you can see where it is. I will also improve the styling to make it stand out more.

