## metadata.json

Ensure the project name is correct here as well for consistent deployment identity.

```json
{
  "name": "Ungana Medical",
  "description": "An AI-enhanced application for medical students to integrate knowledge across disciplines using multidisciplinary patient cases and interactive knowledge maps. It helps connect concepts from biochemistry to sociology for holistic patient care.",
  "requestFramePermissions": [
    "microphone"
  ]
}

To address your points:

1.  **"Synapsis Medical Evaluation" Project Name**: The name displayed in the "Select a Cloud Project" dropdown during deployment comes directly from your **Google Cloud Platform (GCP) Console**. Changing the code or repository name *does not* rename the existing project on Google's servers.
    *   **Solution:** You must go to the [Google Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com/), select the project "Synapsis Medical Evaluation", go to **IAM & Admin > Settings**, and change the **Project name** there. Then, refresh your deployment tool.

2.  **Missing Speech-to-Text**: The microphone button was previously hidden if your browser didn't explicitly report support for the Speech API.
    *   **Solution:** I have updated the `DiscussionModal` to **always display the microphone button**. If your browser doesn't support it, the button will be visible but disabled (grayed out), so you can at least see where it is. I've also updated the cache to ensure you get this latest version immediately.

